{"unit_id":"hanrr92__dsh-code-quote#card-zh","repo":"hanrr92/dsh-code-quote","commit":"1d6f6b1ddd18d3e1f4d890180b5fe4138bf4b3d7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-code-quote 是面向 DSH Web 输入框的代码引用插件。粘贴带有文件路径和行号的代码时，它会把长文本折叠成紧凑的文件引用芯片；在发送消息前，宿主端会识别引用标记并附加对应的完整代码快照。它也支持从侧边栏插入路径和行号后读取工作区文件片段，并提供快照持久化、阈值配置和芯片显示开关，适合在 DSH 对话中引用代码而不让草稿充满代码。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:175-202"]}
{"unit_id":"hanrr92__dsh-code-quote#card-en","repo":"hanrr92/dsh-code-quote","commit":"1d6f6b1ddd18d3e1f4d890180b5fe4138bf4b3d7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-code-quote folds pasted path-and-line snippets into file chips in the DSH web composer. Before sending, its host attaches the saved code snapshot to model context. It can fetch workspace lines and persist recent snapshots locally, with configurable thresholds and chip mode.","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:175-202"]}
