{"unit_id":"hanrr92__dsh-code-quote#caveat-1","repo":"hanrr92/dsh-code-quote","commit":"1d6f6b1ddd18d3e1f4d890180b5fe4138bf4b3d7","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-code-quote 使用本机快照文件保存最近的代码引用，默认位置在 DSH_HOME 下的 storages/dsh-code-quote/snapshots.json；最多保留 64 条，重启后载回。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plugin.js:25-27"]}
